ets sector with the launch of the world’s first USD 2 billion institutional-grade emerald investment opportunity. Headquartered in Zug, Switzerland, the company connects the lasting value of rare gemstones with modern blockchain technology.\n\nIts flagship product, EmGEMx, offers fractional ownership in a carefully selected and securely stored portfolio of emeralds. The gemstones are appraised by trusted gemological laboratories such as Gübelin and WGI, and the investment structure is audited by global firm Grant Thornton. The opportunity is further supported by strategic partners including Chainlink, Fireblocks, Zodia Custody, and Seabury Capital Group.\n\nTargeting the USD 60 billion colored gemstone market and the rapidly growing USD 16 trillion real-world asset space, GEMx combines strong institutional focus, a robust compliance framework, and high-level partnerships to deliver a secure and forward-looking investment opportunity.","daily_mints_token":{"val":49089.3,"val_7d":49089.3,"val_30d":49089.3,"val_90d":49089.3,"chg_7d_amt":0,"chg_7d_pct":0,"chg_30d_amt":0,"chg_30d_pct":0,"chg_90d_amt":0,"chg_90d_pct":0},"daily_mints_dollar":{"val":49089.3,"val_7d":49089.3,"val_30d":49089.3,"val_90d":49089.3,"chg_7d_amt":0,"chg_7d_pct":0,"chg_30d_amt":0,"chg_30d_pct":0,"chg_90d_amt":0,"chg_90d_pct":0},"holding_addresses_count":{"val":9,"val_7d":9,"val_30d":9,"val_90d":9,"chg_7d_amt":0,"chg_7d_pct":0,"chg_30d_amt":0,"chg_30d_pct":0,"chg_90d_amt":0,"chg_90d_pct":0},"adjusted_daily_mints_token":{"val":49089.3,"val_7d":49089.3,"val_30d":49089.3,"val_90d":49089.3,"chg_7d_amt":0,"chg_7d_pct":0,"chg_30d_amt":0,"chg_30d_pct":0,"chg_90d_amt":0,"chg_90d_pct":0},"bridged_token_value_dollar":{"val":309228.44,"val_7d":309228.44,"val_30d":309228.44,"val_90d":309228.44,"chg_7d_amt":0,"chg_7d_pct":0,"chg_30d_amt":0,"chg_30d_pct":0,"chg_90d_amt":0,"chg_90d_pct":0},"adjusted_daily_mints_dollar":{"val":49089.3,"val_7d":49089.3,"val_30d":49089.3,"val_90d":49089.3,"chg_7d_amt":0,"chg_7d_pct":0